        <title type="html"><![CDATA[docs(headers): clarify quotes requirement in Content-Disposition of multipart/form-data]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42065</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42065"/>
        <updated>2025-11-23T22:17:24.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11341955?u=4aed4baa1449f2d137eddc1614b6b4493832a9c1&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Clarify that quotes in Content-Disposition's directives are not required in the RFC standard but are encouraged for compatibility.</p>

<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">The current content says the quotes in directives of multipart/form-data's Content-Disposition are required, but it's NOT required in the RFC standard. See the issue linked below for more details.</p>

<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7578#section-4.2" rel="nofollow">https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7578#section-4.2</a><br>
<a href="https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc6266.html#n-grammar" rel="nofollow">https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc6266.html#n-grammar</a></p>

<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3553511197" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41683" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/41683/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41683">#41683</a></p>



]]></content>
