<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Firefox 146 adds a feature whereby large numbers of unused CSS variables are hidden in the devtools rules view. See <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1719461" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1719461</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">I've done some testing and have found that:</p>
<ol dir="auto">
<li>The feature is enabled by default in nightly 147 and beta 146, so it isn't hidden behind a pref, and isn't a nightly-only feature.</li>
<li>The number of unused variables that causes the feature to kick in is 10, so I've reported it as "10 or more".</li>
</ol>

